---
layout: layouts/base.njk
description: QuitUSM is a movement to reclaim our life from screens.
ctas:
  - title: Read the Book
    description: The QuitUSM Book lays out why compulsive screen use takes hold, and a practical path to letting it go.
    icon: menu_book
    label: Coming soon
  - title: Follow a Guide
    description: Step-by-step guides for cutting back on social media, video, and endless scrolling, at your own pace.
    icon: explore
    label: Browse guides
    href: /guides/getting-started/
  - title: Read the Blog
    description: Stories, research, and reflections from people who have stepped back from their screens.
    icon: article
    label: Visit the blog
    href: /blog/
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__image" src="/images/home_banner.jpg" alt="" width="2090" height="1011">
  <div class="hero__text container">
    <h1 class="hero__title">{{ site.name }}</h1>
    <p class="hero__tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container home">
  <p class="home__intro">
    Our screens were meant to serve us, yet many of us now spend our best hours scrolling,
    swiping, and refreshing. QuitUSM is a community of people choosing to take that time back.
    We share honest guides, research, and stories to help you build a life where technology
    is a tool you pick up on purpose, not a habit that picks you up.
  </p>

  <ul class="cta-list" role="list">
    {% for cta in ctas %}
    <li class="cta card">
      <div class="cta__body">
        <h2 class="cta__title">{{ cta.title }}</h2>
        <p class="cta__description">{{ cta.description }}</p>
      </div>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined cta__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ cta.icon }}</span>
      {% if cta.href %}
      <a class="button cta__button" href="{{ cta.href }}">{{ cta.label }}</a>
      {% else %}
      <span class="button button--disabled cta__button" aria-disabled="true">{{ cta.label }}</span>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
